# Admin UI

## Purpose

React 19 + TypeScript admin surface. CSS tokens only - sources: `web/src/styles/tokens.css`, `main.css`, `components.css`, `a11y.css`. Visual: Geist zinc dark; Grafana Saga UX principles (not `@grafana/ui`).

JSDoc: every function, module constant, block-scoped arrow callback (`quality.mdc`).

## Design tokens

| Token | Usage |
| :--- | :--- |
| `--bg-canvas` | Page shell, inputs |
| `--bg-surface`, `--bg-surface-hover` | Panels, hover |
| `--border-color`, `--border-strong` | Dividers, controls |
| `--text-main`, `--text-secondary`, `--text-muted` | Body, labels, hints |
| `--accent` | Primary CTA, links, focus |
| `--radius-sm` (6px) | Buttons, inputs |
| `--radius-lg`, `--radius-modal` (12px) | Modals, menus |
| `--spacing-4` ... `--spacing-48` | 4px grid; default gaps 16/24 |
| `--success`, `--warning`, `--danger`, `--info` | Status only |

Rules: border over shadow (shadows on modal/toast/menu only); dark default; **no hard-coded hex** in components.

## Typography

| Class | Use |
| :--- | :--- |
| `.text-heading-24` | Page titles |
| `.text-heading-20` | Section titles |
| `.text-label-14` / `.text-copy-14` | Nav, buttons, body |
| `.font-mono` | IDs, money, KPI values |

One `h1` per view; continuous heading ranks; color = status, not emphasis.

## Page templates

Reuse before inventing:

| Template | Structure |
| :--- | :--- |
| Overview | `PageHeader` -> alerts -> `KpiGrid` -> sections |
| List | header + filters + `data-table` + `EmptyState` |
| Detail | header + tabs/panels + header actions |
| Settings | header + `SectionCard` stack + action bar |
| Wizard | stepper + one column + single primary CTA |

Required chrome: `PageHeader` on every authenticated page; `PageStack`; `PageSkeleton` loading; `EmptyState` for empty (title + one sentence + optional CTA).

Confirm friction: `confirm_catalog` - low for renames; confirm for pause, revoke key, budget overwrite.

## API wiring workflow

Before shipping a page:

1. Read Go handler DTO first (`internal/controlplane/*_handlers.go`, `*_dto.go`).
2. Match `json` field names in `web/src/types/` and `helpers/*_api.ts`.
3. Gate live routes: `bash scripts/ci/report_live_routes_gate.sh` - `live: true` requires real `/api/v1` backend.
4. Use `FreshnessBadge` when endpoint returns `stale` or freshness metadata.

## Product honesty (extends anti-slop)

Forbidden:

- `live: true` on stub routes
- Fetch then always empty table
- Silent `catch` without `renderErrorBlock`
- "Saved" toast before 2xx
- Form fields not in Go DTO
- Hardcoded demo KPIs
- Echo secrets after save

Required:

- `StubBanner` for 501
- `renderErrorBlock` on errors
- `apiConfirmed` on mutations
- Money via `formatUsdDecimal` / `formatAmountMicro`

